zzle mechanism – kill the player character to respawn them in more favourable locations<br>- Original soundtrack including 12 songs with full vocals sung by characters in the game while you play<br>- Fully voice-acted interactions with 48 different characters<br>- Staircases beyond your wildest dreams<br> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1449570/extras/5ffe550140cd0a494df48e8266df57d5.poster.avif?t=1641520693\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1449570/extras/5ffe550140cd0a494df48e8266df57d5.webm?t=1641520693\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1449570/extras/5ffe550140cd0a494df48e8266df57d5.mp4?t=1641520693\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>", "short_description": "A puzzle adventure from Erik Hermansen, creator of Deadly Rooms of Death. Fling yourself into 58 massive puzzle levels. Stack blocks, dodge cops, die to progress, and discover the secrets of the afterlife.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1449570/header.jpg?t=1641520693", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1449570/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1641520693", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1449570/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1641520693", "website": "https://seespacelabs.com/the-godkiller", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS *:</strong> Windows 7 SP1 64 bit or newer<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><st